    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/197d8e4dae7f2021ff81feeb4eb337c1.avif?t=1750925789\" width=300 height=96 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>is a rogue-like shooter tower defense experience set in a stunning synthwave-inspired universe. Step into a world of neon lights, pounding original synthwave soundtrack, and intense action as you defend six vital towers from never-ending waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique: blast through hordes of foes, level up, and choose from a variety of powerful upgrades to adapt your strategy. The challenge increases with each wave, pushing your skills and reflexes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can to collect gold and, after each run, use your earnings to permanently upgrade the pool of upgrades you\u2019ll find in future games. Experiment with different builds, unlock new abilities, and become the ultimate defender in a dazzling 80\u2019s-inspired cyber battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/92af70fd844ef8abb0d93de172475db8.webp?t=1750925789\" width=256 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced rogue-like shooter and tower defense hybrid gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend six towers from relentless waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and choose from a wide variety of upgrades each run<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/3edd3e69670fdac8598f95c12d4f3b2c.avif?t=1750925789\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold and unlock permanent meta-upgrades to customize your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning synthwave 80\u2019s visuals mixed with modern graphical effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original, pulse-pounding synthwave soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability with procedurally generated enemy waves and upgrade combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the chaos and protect your towers in Command-\u03a9 Omega?<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/d07f7efb79d1db11c9003492784a481c.poster.avif?t=1750925789\" width=250 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/d07f7efb79d1db11c9003492784a481c.webm?t=1750925789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/197d8e4dae7f2021ff81feeb4eb337c1.avif?t=1750925789\" width=300 height=96 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br>is a rogue-like shooter tower defense experience set in a stunning synthwave-inspired universe. Step into a world of neon lights, pounding original synthwave soundtrack, and intense action as you defend six vital towers from never-ending waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique: blast through hordes of foes, level up, and choose from a variety of powerful upgrades to adapt your strategy. The challenge increases with each wave, pushing your skills and reflexes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can to collect gold and, after each run, use your earnings to permanently upgrade the pool of upgrades you\u2019ll find in future games. Experiment with different builds, unlock new abilities, and become the ultimate defender in a dazzling 80\u2019s-inspired cyber battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806090/extras/92af70fd844ef8abb0d93de172475db8.webp?t=1750925789\" width=256 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced rogue-like shooter and tower defense hybrid gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend six towers from relentless waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and choose from a wide variety of upgrades 